WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.040 --> 00:00:05.000
Hey YouTubers what’s up? So this is going to
be my Game of Thrones video about Qyburn.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:09.670
So he's loosely tied to the citadel, I did my citadel video last week so this is just a continuition of that.

00:00:09.670 --> 00:00:15.100
I've also got news about the IMAX trailer of the screening and the Season 5 premiere date so I’ll talk

00:00:15.100 --> 00:00:17.700
about all that stuff after I get through with Qyburn

00:00:17.700 --> 00:00:22.660
Qyburn’s nickname is the Bloody Maester, he definitely earned that too, he trained at the Citadel but the

00:00:22.660 --> 00:00:27.460
Conclave of Archmaesters stripped him of his chain
because he was performing experiments on Living

00:00:27.460 --> 00:00:35.460
People. George RR Martin hasn’t fully explained
what those experiments were. Qyburn said that

00:00:35.460 --> 00:00:42.040
he opened the bodies of the living to better
understand death. That can mean a lot of things.

00:00:42.040 --> 00:00:46.530
The Conclave has a very narrow view of what
it considers proper areas of study. Qyburn

00:00:46.530 --> 00:00:52.250
is an extreme example of someone they disciplined
but they ostracized Archmaester Marwyn for

00:00:52.250 --> 00:00:53.950
studying magic and the occult.

00:00:53.950 --> 00:01:00.950
I’m going to talk about his character history
first before I get into theories and potential

00:01:03.430 --> 00:01:04.649
spoilers.

00:01:04.649 --> 00:01:08.940
After Qyburn was kicked out, he joined the
Brave Companions as their healer. He’s not

00:01:08.940 --> 00:01:13.780
a fighter and none of the major Houses would
hire him. On the TV Show, that group is represented

00:01:13.780 --> 00:01:17.600
by Locke’s posse here. We meet them for
the first time in Season 3 when Locke comes

00:01:17.600 --> 00:01:19.400
up on Jaime and Brienne on the bridge here.

00:01:19.400 --> 00:01:24.950
This is Locke, in the books his name is Vargo
Hoat. They’re one of the minor sellsword

00:01:24.950 --> 00:01:29.120
companies from Qohor. Twyin Lannister brought
them to Westeros during the War of the Five

00:01:29.120 --> 00:01:35.790
Kings to fight for him.

00:01:35.790 --> 00:01:42.790
We don’t see 
a lot of Qyburn until after he’s rescued
on the battlefield by Talisa Stark. I think

00:01:47.920 --> 00:01:53.560
this was his first on camera scene, when Robb
Stark takes Harrenhal.

00:01:53.560 --> 00:02:00.560
Before the battle he was unofficially working
for Tywin Lannister. Only because the Brave

00:02:03.020 --> 00:02:10.020
Companions had sword allegiance to him. After
the Battle they turn cloak and start working

00:02:11.819 --> 00:02:17.079
for Roose Bolton, who at the time was still
loyal to Robb Stark.

00:02:17.079 --> 00:02:24.079
When Roose Bolton takes Harrenhaal, Qyburn
becomes the new Maester. The old maester was

00:02:25.870 --> 00:02:32.870
killed during the sack. When Jaime and Brienne
are brought to Harenhaal later by the Brave

00:02:38.150 --> 00:02:40.279
Companions, Qyburn is the one who fixes Jaime’s
bloody stump.

00:02:40.279 --> 00:02:47.279
He’s a very good healer, one of the best
in the realm. The reason he seems so shady

00:02:48.590 --> 00:02:51.299
is because he’s got that Frankenstein vibe.

00:02:51.299 --> 00:02:54.950
If you haven’t seen it, you should watch
Christopher Nolan’s Prestige. It’s a great

00:02:54.950 --> 00:03:00.329
movie, but David Bowie plays Nikola Tesla
in it and has this amazing scene.

00:03:00.329 --> 00:03:07.109
“You're familiar with the phrase "Man's
reach exceeds his grasp"? It's a lie. Man's

00:03:07.109 --> 00:03:08.319
grasp exceeds his nerve.

00:03:08.319 --> 00:03:10.650
The only limits on scientific progress are
those imposed by society. The first time I

00:03:10.650 --> 00:03:17.650
changed the world, I was hailed as a visionary.
The second time I was asked politely to retire.

00:03:20.549 --> 00:03:23.969
Nothing is impossible, Mr. Angier, what you
want is simply expensive.”

00:03:23.969 --> 00:03:28.459
Tesla was a brilliant scientist and engineer
in real life, but because Thomas Edison and

00:03:28.459 --> 00:03:33.319
the rest of the intellectual community weren’t
ready for some of his ideas, they cast him

00:03:33.319 --> 00:03:35.639
into obscurity.

00:03:35.639 --> 00:03:39.620
Qyburn is like the Nikola Tesla of Game of
Thrones.

00:03:39.620 --> 00:03:43.260
The last time we saw him was treating the
Mountain after the fight with Oberyn Martell.

00:03:43.260 --> 00:03:47.019
The books make it seem more gruesome but the
net effect is still the same. The Mountain

00:03:47.019 --> 00:03:53.349
is right on the edge of death and Qyburn intervenes
and that’s the last we hear about it.

00:03:53.349 --> 00:04:00.349
I read the books but the first time I saw
this scene all I could think about was what

00:04:00.870 --> 00:04:07.870
he was replacing his bodily fluids with.
The problem was the venom running through

00:04:11.400 --> 00:04:13.519
his body needed to be swapped out.

00:04:13.519 --> 00:04:17.560
This is getting into theorycrafting so I’ll
put this spoiler tag up in case you don’t

00:04:17.560 --> 00:04:20.100
want to think about anything in book 4. Okay,
here we go.

00:04:20.100 --> 00:04:24.010
I feel like we’re all thinking the same
thing here: The Mountain is Robert Strong.

00:04:24.010 --> 00:04:30.220
The question is, how did Qyburn do it? I’m
inclined to think he’s mostly using science.

00:04:30.220 --> 00:04:35.100
If it were Marwyn, I’d say the opposite.
But Qyburn is all about human science.

00:04:35.100 --> 00:04:42.100
The best theory I’ve seen is that he’s
been experimenting with Stem Cells.

00:04:42.400 --> 00:04:49.400
Cersei had given him Margaery’s spy Senelle
to use in his experiments and he requested

00:04:55.130 --> 00:05:02.130
more women. Saying she was exhausted. So Cersei
gives him more women.

00:05:07.020 --> 00:05:13.880
It’s possible Qyburn is using their reproductive
organs to cultivate stem cells and re-grow

00:05:13.880 --> 00:05:18.190
most of The Mountain’s internal organs.
Replace the ones destroyed by the poison.

00:05:18.190 --> 00:05:25.190
Okay, spoiler part over.

00:05:31.460 --> 00:05:38.460
The show might simplify the argument, but
Qyburn is one of the most interesting side

00:05:40.810 --> 00:05:46.090
characters in King’s Landing. I don’t
expect the producers to get super detailed

00:05:46.090 --> 00:05:52.830
with explanations so we can compare this with
the book when they start airing episodes.

